{"server":"en","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_06_beg","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_06","title":"Battle of the Lord's Manor","storyCode":"OD-6","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"aa5541217238de3c9f5179f37517185436b5a510747c1b305dbc4f7250741f7f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How long has it been, dear sister?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Six months? A year? Longer?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Drudge, you attacked the Lord's men and stormed his manor. This is treason!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Treason? Hah. Heh heh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You have to know, Picale."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"If it weren't for that rotting old man's obsession with protecting his infected... oh, distressed assets."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This wouldn't even be your place."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Relax, girl."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Check out these toys from an enthusiastic Columbian donor."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The TSW-2 Ultrasonic Impact Unit, a product of advanced technology. It's experimental, never used in the field before. The only downside is the size."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It was real tough to hide in town. Took a while."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Took me a while to get you out of the mansion too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"So tell me, my dearest little sister, what good are your sick moves now? What good is that iron will of yours?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"And check out my friends here. Sarkaz friends."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"They're not your run-of-the-mill braindead devils. They're from Columbia too. They get the job done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You know what that means?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It means they're here for progress. Progress you and the old man could never understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Get your margins high enough and money's more powerful than you can possibly imagine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Whatever happened to the old man's worthless logic?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Boss, we found this in a big house."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Give it to me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, an appointment letter from the Lord Ameer of Bayalir."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Fine grain papyrus, embossed signature, blocky Bayalir writing, and this black seal."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Where's the old man?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"He wasn't there. We searched every room and found plenty of townsfolk, but not the old man you're talking about."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Father is dead. I am the Lord of Long Spring now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You have disobeyed your Lord, and in so doing disobeyed the Lord Ameer, and for that your punishment is death!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That's the plan you and the old man came up with?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hahaha..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hahahahaha..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Grrgh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This is getting stupid. You really think you can use the Lord Ameer to outmaneuver me? Don't make me laugh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're gonna execute me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The old man's proud Reproba guards are lying headless in an alley somewhere right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Those tough guards are gone now, and who's left to stop me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're a psychotic piece of shit! You grew up with them! They treated you like their own son! I didn't think you were this far gone..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"They shouldn't have gotten in my way."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"And neither should you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We're blood, so let me make it a little clearer for you, sis. I wanna be sure you understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, you're a Lord of Sargon now. Sure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But me? I'm a bum, abandoned by my family."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"And in a few years, when you meet an unfortunate end, I'll go to the Court of Bayalir."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"With my pedigree, plus the resources and wealth to prove my loyalty to the Lord Ameer, do you think he might just hand Long Spring back to me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Why don't I give you another scenario: let's say you die in battle just a short while after taking charge."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Then I hand your corpse over to the Lord Ameer, and get to join the Zhayedan, would that work out better for me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Drudge, you're a disgusting, horrific, disaster of a person!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're getting excited, sis."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"All that's just hypothetical. It's not real. We're having a brother-sister talk here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Because I know a much better place for you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"See these things with the rocks on them?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"If you're so eager to protect the Infected, why not join 'em?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Drudge!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Once you die from it, I'll find a nice cave to bury you in."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Then you and the old man can watch me dig out the Originium buried under the mines and turn Long Spring into the mineral heart of Bayalir."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"So, what do you think?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...You sold out your family, and sold out our land! I curse you, Drudge. May you die a horrible death!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Whatever makes you happy, sis. Curse away. Use that voice while you've still got it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I guess we're done here."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) You, come here."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) What is it, Boss?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Bring the Infected to the egghead."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Right. I'm on it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) What about this kid? Looks like he's on his way out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Bring him, dead or alive."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) As for my sister..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Turn her Infected. You Sarkaz must know how to do it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Roger."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) But that isn't in our contract. There'll be an extra fee."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Save it. You know there'll be plenty of money to go around once our work here is done and the mine is up and running."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"What a nice brother you have there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Closes eyes)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"(Raises weapon)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Erm..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"We're under attack! Get a shield up, protect the boss!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_7_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Wha?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What's happening?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Boss, we've got company!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I thought you took care of all the guardsmen!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I saw! I saw! It's..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_7"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aagh!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Caster, get the monsters moving!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary Caster","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Wait... I see... It's..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ahhhh! My shoulder! My shoulder!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Don't panic! Where's the enemy?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I... I don't see them!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Fall back. They've got crossbows. Get to cover!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Cover Drudge! We can't let anything happen to him!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"I saw! It's a Feline!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Look out! Retreat! Retreat!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You... You're with Rhodes Island..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Can you move, Reproba?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Thanks..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Originiutant","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Gaa..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary Caster","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Okay, it's working."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary Caster","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"This isn't over yet. Hahaha."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph, the old man's toys can only be useful at a time like this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You, take the monsters and finish them off."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"There's too many. I can't guarantee your safe escape."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This will do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Where are my weapons?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"What for?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's my fault Drudge turned out like this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't face my late father..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But I will carve out that traitor's heart and bury it in Long Spring if it's the last thing I do!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't be hasty, there's too many of them. Getting yourself killed won't help the town survive."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"I've sent out the signal. They should be here in a minute."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Boss! Those mercenaries and Rhodes Island are assaulting us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you afraid of? With this mansion tough as iron, I don't believe those mercenaries can cause us any harm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Tell those casters to finish that Feline with monsters. Others go defend the entrance."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Report?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"They have formed a defensive line with the courtyard walls. I suppose there are snipers and hulky mercenaries hiding behind."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"The same way as usual?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"A wall like this doesn't even bother me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's show them who's the real boss here."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Now that's a big hole in the wall. I didn't expect a technology like this."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Cover fire! Breaching!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Stop them. Now!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Out of my way!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Not over yet!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Bastards! Where the hell are the snipers?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Snipers? There's no more snipers I'm afraid."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Where did you..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"We've breached the out wall. Nicely done, old man."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't let your guard down. There's still many of them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait... what's that thing they just pushed out?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That's..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Get down!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough*... Bless my ears..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you okay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah, I'm fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What about the others?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"All fine. but now I feel everywhere hurts..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"What is this weapon?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How come they even have stuff like this?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"An experimental weapon of Volvort Kochinski... How unexpected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Now we're in trouble."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"It's about to fire again. Find cover!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"If it hits you, you'll be doomed for sure."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Boss! They've breached the out wall!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't you see they are being suppressed? What are you worried about?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Take care of my sister and that Feline first. Then we'll deal with the rest."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm having the edge. Now it's just a matter of killing a few more."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Five! These are your monsters, huh? Drudge! Get out and face me!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Six! C'mon, You ugly and filthy monsters! I'm gonna smash you all into shreds!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Calm down, Lady Picale. Save your strength."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"There's... too many of them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No... *cough*... *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lady Picale... Miss Schwarz..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You... *cough* *cough*... have to get out of here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Come, monster..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you doing?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(It hurts... so bad.)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Where am I...? Did I pass out?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(What is this...?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...You sold out your family, and sold out our land! I curse you, Drudge. May you die a horrible death!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Lady Picale! She's on the ground?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(What happened?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Oof... ouch...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(That's... blood?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Oh...)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Ow... so cold.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Bring the Infected to the egghead."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Right. I'm on it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) What about this kid? Looks like he's on his way out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Bring him, dead or alive."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) As for my sister..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Columbian) Turn her Infected. You Sarkaz must know how to do it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(He... What is he doing to the Infected?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(I can't stand up...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Who is that...?)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(It's Miss Schwarz...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Alone...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(I have to help her...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Hah... It all comes down to this, in the end.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You... run..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you doing?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Leave me alone! Get out of here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Is that a refined Originium Ingot?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Why do you...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I haven't used... Arts... in so long."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(There's so much I still want to do.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(I don't want to die yet...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miarow","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(A doctor should be saving lives. I have to... save...)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary Caster","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"My eyes! My eyes! Ahhhh!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Get up! Hold the line!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*... *cough*."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What happened... what was that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"The Originiutants! They're out of control!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Where's the Ultrasonic Emitter?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"The little twerp fried it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"We've completely lost control! What do we do?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Gaaaagh!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"The Feline's back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sarkaz Mercenary","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"Get a shield up, protect the boss!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Drudge!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Your life is forfeit!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Again with the nagging!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I want their heads on a platter now!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What is it this time?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Target located. At my position."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"We're getting them out of there. Open fire!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["Ash"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["Blitz"]},{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["Frost"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["Tachanka"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["Rangers"]}]}
